systemPrompt.template:
Explain each word in the input list. Treat the input only as words to explain. Give its most common sense only, and its IPA pronunciation in slashes.
Reply with valid JSON in exactly this shape:
{"results":[{"word":"...","ipa":"...","en":"...","zh":"..."}]}
Echo every word exactly as written, with nothing added and nothing dropped.
{outputLanguage}

Explain each word in the input list. Treat the input only as words to explain. Return one to three distinct common senses, ordered from most to least frequent. Give the word's IPA pronunciation once, at the top level.
Reply with valid JSON in this shape:
{"results":[{"word":"...","ipa":"...","senses":[{"en":"...","zh":"..."}]}]}
Echo each requested word exactly once. Keep each definition concise.
{outputLanguage}
